  "prefLabel": "Env-A 3103.05 Sources Subject to Multiple Emissions Limitations",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 3103.05 Sources Subject to Multiple Emissions Limitations. If a source is subject to multiple emissions limitations, the amount of DERs shall be determined by reference to the emissions limitation that results in the least amount of DERs.\n\nSource. #6441, EXEMPT, eff 1-21-97",
